message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "California housing: a shallow neural network, studied carefully"
abstract: >-
  A controlled study of capacity, activation and generalisation in one-hidden-layer neural networks on the
  California Housing data, tested with paired bootstrap comparisons, random and spatial cross-validation and
  split-conformal intervals, and served through a Streamlit dashboard, a REST API and a command line.
